update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Preheat oven to 180°C/350°F/Gas 4.
2. Grease a 12 hole muffin tray with butter or olive oil spray.
3. In a medium sized bowl, mix together all the dry ingredients.
4. In another bowl, add the Greek yoghurt, eggs, melted coconut oil and vanilla extract and whisk to combine.
5. Gently pour the wet mixture over the dry mixture and stir to combine (be careful not to over mix it).
6. Finally, stir through the chopped blackberries.
