update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Heat 1 tsp of the oil in a large non-stick frying pan, then add the tomatoes and cook, cut side down, over a medium heat.
2. Meanwhile, beat the eggs together with the yoghurt, 2 tbsp water, lots of black pepper and the basil.
