update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Begin by preheating your oven to 200°C/400°F/gas 6 and line a large rimmed baking sheet with parchment or greaseproof paper.
2. Then in small bowl, whisk together 1 egg and 1 tbsp water then set aside.
3. In medium bowl, combine the ricotta, spinach, basil, tomatoes, red pepper, remaining egg and ¼ tsp salt.
4. Unroll the pie crusts and cut each into 4 equal wedges.
