update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Preheat oven to 180°C/350°F/gas 5 and line a baking tray with baking paper.
2. Place all ingredients in a large bowl and mix well to combine.
3. Spread the mix across a baking tray (use 2 if you need, as you don’t want to crowd the tray).
