update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Start by bringing a large pot of water to boil.
2. Cook the potatoes for 8 minutes, then drain.
3. Next, heat the oil and butter in a large non-stick frying pan and add the courgette, peppers, boiled potatoes and a little salt and pepper.
4. Cook for 10 minutes, stirring from time to time, until everything begins to brown.
5. Add the spring onions, garlic and thyme and cook for another 2 minutes.
6. Make four spaces in the pan and crack in the eggs.
