update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Heat the oil in a large wok on medium-high heat.
2. Cook the beef for 4-5 minutes or until cooked to your liking.
3. Remove from the pan, cover with aluminium foil and set aside.
4. Add the vegetables to the same wok and cook for 3-4 minutes.
