update public.recipes set method=$r$1. by mixing all the marinade ingredients together. the beef in the marinade and allow it to sit for minutes. mix together the sauce ingredients and set aside. the bok choy in a large fry pan, along with 3 tbsp of Put the lid on and bring the fry pan to medium heat. for 3 minutes, drain and set aside. the coconut oil to a large wok and bring to medium Cook the garlic and ginger for 1-2 minutes, stirring so it doesn’t stick.
2. Turn the heat up a little and add the beef.
