update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Fry the spring onion whites in a wok for 2 mins until softened.
2. Stir in the pepper and cook for another 1 minute, and then the pineapple and cook for 1 minute more.
3. Finally stir in the green curry paste and soy sauce.
4. Next, add the cooked rice and stir fry until piping hot.
