update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Start by heating your grill to medium.
2. Meanwhile, boil the peas and beans for 4 minutes until just tender, then drain well.
3. Beat the eggs with a little of the milk and some salt and pepper.
4. Slice 4 thin, round slices of goat’s cheese (you’ll use about 50g), roughly chop or crumble the rest into pieces, then stir this into the eggs along with the vegetables and mint.
