10. Some great alternatives to cod and slightly more budget friendly options are pollack, coley, hake or whiting.$r$ where name=$r$Cod Provencal$r$ and image_url not like $x$%abook-%$x$;
update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Begin by preheating your oven to 200°C/400°F/gas 6.
2. Meanwhile, butterfly the chicken breasts by slicing them in half through the middle so you have two thinner pieces.
