6. Enjoy this tasty dish with our simple nan bread recipe!$r$ where name=$r$Chicken Saag$r$ and image_url not like $x$%abook-%$x$;
update public.recipes set method=$r$1. Add 1 tablespoons of sunflower oil in a wok and bring to a medium heat.
2. Meanwhile, toss the butternut squash cubes into the soy sauce.
3. Put the soy-coated butternut squash in the wok and cook for 10 minutes or until softened and browned, stirring frequently.
