6. If the chocolate seems too thick after melting, you can add a tsp of melted coconut oil to thin it out.
7. Dip each macaroon into the melted chocolate and/or drizzle chocolate over each macaroon.
8. Place macaroons in the fridge for 5-10 minutes to allow the chocolate to harden.
